  "body": "I've set SUPER+E to open up Nautilus and that not longer functions once I install ART. SUPER+E will now instead open up ART. Morevover, clicking the icon of a mounted drive in Dash To Dock will no long work to open up Nautlius. \n\nChanging my custom Nautilus shortcut to something else, SUPER+F, for instance, still opens up ART, instead of `Files`.\n\nUsing ART on Archlinux, btw. I've tried both the binary and building from scratch, the behaviour is the same.",
